config CHARYBDIS_USB_FLASH
    bool "USB 1200-baud touch enters the nice!nano bootloader"
    depends on USB_CDC_ACM && UART_LINE_CTRL
    select CDC_ACM_DTE_RATE_CALLBACK_SUPPORT
    help
      A USB host can request UF2 bootloader mode by setting the Charybdis
      CDC port to 1200 baud and closing it. Only USB has this capability.
      Normal plugging, Studio traffic and Bluetooth do not request a reset.
      This does not erase settings or change the bootloader itself.
